OL,3,GNEWSALeaders react to delay in major
OL,4,Acouncil overhaul
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leaders in Lincolnshire have
OL,7,Fgiven their reactions after plans to
OL,8,Fredraw the county's local authority map
OL,9,Fwere put on hold.
OL,11,FAn expanded City of Lincoln Council and
OL,12,Fa Lincolnshire unitary authority had
OL,13,Fbeen planned as replacements for the
OL,14,Fseven existing district councils and
OL,15,FLincolnshire County Council.
OL,17,FBut Lincolnshire is among 14 areas
OL,18,Fwhere local government reorganisation
OL,19,F(LGR) has been halted.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
